"""English fallback tooltips for the same declared path mechanics as ruRU."""
DESCRIPTIONS = {
    'stealth': ('After 3 continuous seconds in Stealth, removes its movement penalty and increases stealth level by 1. Benefits end on leaving Stealth.', 'The first direct special attack begun in Stealth or within 3 sec after leaving costs 20 less energy and deals 10% more direct damage. Consumed when the attack begins.'),
    'vanish': ('Removes snares, roots and the hostile bleed with the longest remaining duration. Existing hostile periodic damage does not break Stealth for 3 sec; direct damage still does.', 'Cooldown reduced by 45 sec. Restores 40 energy over 4 sec. The first special attack from Stealth gains 30% final critical damage, then increases damage taken by 10% for 6 sec. A non-critical attack also consumes the window.'),
    'sprint': ('Retains normal speed and duration. Removes snares and roots and grants immunity to them for 4 sec.', 'Increases movement speed by 100% for 8 sec.'),
    'evasion': ('Lasts 20 sec. Retains normal dodge and reduces physical damage from attacks that land by 15%.', 'Lasts 8 sec, with a 2-minute cooldown. Each dodge restores 5 energy.'),
    'cloak_of_shadows': ('Retains the normal magic cleanse. Avoids hostile spells with 100% chance for 4 sec, then reduces magic damage taken by 20% for 4 sec.', 'Lasts 3 sec with a 60-sec cooldown. Retains the normal magic cleanse. Your poisons deal 20% more damage and cannot miss or be resisted while active.'),
    'feint': ('Costs 20 energy. Reduces area damage taken by 70% for 8 sec; retains the other normal effects.', 'Costs no energy. Reduces area damage taken by 30% for 3 sec. The next direct special attack within that time costs 15 less energy.'),
    'kick': ('A successful interrupt refunds the actual energy spent and extends the interrupted school lockout by 1 sec.', 'A successful interrupt marks the target for 6 sec, increasing direct special-attack damage from you by 10%. Does not increase autos, poisons, bleeds or allies\' damage.'),
    'gouge': ('Cannot be dodged, parried or blocked. Lasts 0.5 sec longer, with normal diminishing returns.', 'Lasts 2.5 sec and grants 2 combo points. Your poisons and bleeds never break it; direct attacks and allies\' damage retain normal break rules.'),
    'kidney_shot': ('At 5 combo points, returns 1 point against the living target when the stun ends, including early removal. The target then deals 20% less damage to you for 4 sec.', 'The 5-point stun lasts at most 5 sec. During the stun, the target takes 15% more damage from all sources. Normal diminishing returns apply.'),
    'rupture': ('Extends duration by 40%, retaining the normal tick interval and adding complete ticks. Includes combo points, talents and glyphs.', 'Deals the normal total bleed damage in 60% of its normal duration, preserving the number of ticks.'),
    'slice_and_dice': ('Retains normal attack speed and increases final duration by 50%.', 'Increases attack speed by 60% and halves final duration.'),
    'eviscerate': ('At 5 combo points this hit ignores 25% armor and restores 10 energy on a successful hit. Otherwise works normally.', 'Consumes up to 30 additional available energy. Each additional energy increases final damage by 1%. Additional cost participates in normal failed-attack refunds.'),
    'deadly_throw': ('Range increased to 40 yards. At 5 combo points interrupts a current spell and locks its school for 3 sec. Retains the normal slow.', 'No longer interrupts. Launches 1 blade each second for 3 sec, each dealing 50% of normal calculated damage. Pays energy and combo points once; only the first blade slows and additional blades cannot proc poisons.'),
    'fan_of_knives': ('Radius increased to 12 yards. Hit targets deal 10% less damage to you for 4 sec.', 'Costs 70 energy. Each weapon strikes twice, each strike dealing 65% of that weapon\'s normal Fan of Knives damage. Each strike can separately apply its weapon poison.'),
    'dismantle': ('Retains the normal disarm duration. After it ends, the target deals 20% less physical damage to you for 6 sec.', 'Disarms for 6 sec. While disarmed, that target takes 15% more damage from you and you gain 20% attack speed against it. Bonuses end with the disarm.'),
    'tricks_of_the_trade': ('Retains normal threat redirection and first-attack activation. The ally gains 10% damage for 10 sec.', 'Retains normal threat redirection and first-attack activation. The ally gains 25% damage for 4 sec.'),
    'mutilate': ('If your Deadly Poison had 5 doses when the attack began, costs 10 less energy and a successful hit extends your Rupture by 1 sec, up to 6 sec per application.', 'If your Deadly Poison had fewer than 5 doses when the attack began, deals 20% more direct damage and applies up to 2 additional doses on a successful hit. Energy cost remains standard.'),
    'envenom': ('Direct damage reduced by 10%. The normal increased-poison-application buff lasts twice as long. Other normal rules remain.', 'Retains normal direct damage but grants no poison-application buff. Detonates 40% of your Deadly Poison\'s remaining periodic damage, then removes all your doses. The detonation cannot trigger poisons.'),
    'hunger_for_blood': ('Costs 10 energy and lasts 2 min with the normal damage bonus. Requires a bleed initially; persists for 10 sec after the last suitable bleed disappears, unless another bleed returns.', 'Costs 30 energy, has a 30-sec cooldown and requires a bleeding target. Increases damage by 12% for 12 sec, then reduces damage by 5% for 6 sec. Recasting does not remove the penalty.'),
    'cold_blood': ('Waits for a 5-point finisher capable of critically hitting. Guarantees its critical hit and restores 20 energy after a successful hit. Other attacks do not consume it.', 'The next direct special attack is a guaranteed critical hit with 40% increased final critical damage. After that attack, damage taken is increased by 10% for 6 sec.'),
    'sinister_strike': ('Every third successful hit restores 10 energy and grants one additional combo point. Misses do not advance the counter.', 'A successful hit has a 20% chance to strike again for 60% of its calculated damage. The extra hit costs no energy, grants no combo point and may apply a weapon poison.'),
    'blade_flurry': ('Lasts 20 sec and grants 10% attack speed. Eligible attacks copy 50% damage to each of up to 2 additional nearby targets. No extra ability cost.', 'Lasts 8 sec and grants 50% attack speed. Eligible attacks copy 100% damage to one additional target. Attacking abilities cost 20% more energy after normal reductions.'),
    'adrenaline_rush': ('Increases energy regeneration by 100% and maximum energy by 20 for 20 sec. Excess energy is clipped when it ends.', 'Increases energy regeneration by 200% for 10 sec, then reduces it by 50% for 4 sec. Maximum energy does not increase.'),
    'killing_spree': ('Retains normal attack count and damage bonus, prioritizing the original target while available. Reduces damage taken by 50% during the sequence.', 'Performs 7 attacks with a 30% damage bonus and cannot be manually cancelled. Increases damage taken by 20% during the sequence and for 4 sec afterwards.'),
    'riposte': ('Retains the parry requirement. Reduces target attack speed by 30% and additionally disarms for 3 sec, respecting normal immunities and diminishing returns.', 'Retains the parry requirement but neither slows nor disarms. A successful hit restores 20 energy and increases attack speed by 25% for 6 sec.'),
    'expose_armor': ('Lasts 12 sec per combo point, up to 60 sec. At 5 points a successful application restores 10 energy. Armor reduction is unchanged.', 'Reduces the target\'s armor by 35%. Lasts 2 sec per combo point, up to 10 sec.'),
    'hemorrhage': ('Direct damage reduced by 10%. Creates 20 personal charges of normal bonus physical damage for 60 sec. Your finishers and allies do not consume charges.', 'Direct damage increased by 20%. Creates 5 personal charges, each granting triple normal bonus damage. Only your eligible attacks consume them.'),
    'ambush': ('Range is 8 yards and the attack grants 3 combo points total.', 'Costs 75 energy and deals 35% more direct damage. A critical hit additionally gains 20% final critical damage.'),
    'garrote': ('Silence lasts 1 sec longer and the bleed lasts 6 sec longer with the normal tick interval and additional complete ticks.', 'Silences for 1 sec and deals normal total bleed damage over 9 sec. For 6 sec, your next successful Eviscerate against that target ignores 30% armor.'),
    'shadowstep': ('May target an enemy or ally and costs no energy. Removes snares and roots. Retains the normal movement boost but removes the next-attack damage boost.', 'Enemy targets only. Range 35 yards, cooldown 15 sec, cost 20 energy. No movement boost; the next eligible direct special attack deals 40% more damage.'),
    'shadow_dance': ('Lasts 10 sec. Stealth-requiring abilities deal 20% less direct damage. Cheap Shot and Garrote cost 15 less energy.', 'Lasts 5 sec and disables Cheap Shot. Ambush and Backstab cost 20 less energy and deal 30% more direct damage against all targets.'),
    'preparation': ('Resets your path variants of Vanish, Sprint, Evasion, Cloak of Shadows and Shadowstep, but not Shadow Dance. Does not reset passive internal cooldowns or penalties.', 'Resets your path variants of Shadow Dance, Shadowstep, Kick and Dismantle and restores 40 energy. Does not reset Sprint, Evasion, Cloak, passive internal cooldowns or penalties.'),
    'premeditation': ('Creates 3 combo points that remain available for 30 sec. Retains normal target rules.', 'Creates 2 combo points and restores 40 energy. Unused created points expire after 6 sec.'),
    'overkill': ('Retains the normal regeneration bonus after leaving Stealth, extending it to 30 sec.', 'After leaving Stealth, increases energy regeneration by 100% for 8 sec.'),
    'seal_fate': ('Retains normal combo-point procs. Each point lost above 5 converts to 5 energy, up to 10 energy per second.', 'A normal proc gains 20% chance per learned rank to grant 2 additional points instead of 1, with a 2-sec internal cooldown on the empowered proc.'),
    'master_poisoner': ('Retains other normal talent effects. Your timed poisons last 50% longer. A hostile dispel can remove at most 2 doses of your Deadly or Wound Poison.', 'Retains other normal talent effects. Your timed poisons last half as long and application chance increases by 20 percentage points. The first Deadly Poison application creates a 4-sec window granting 20% poison damage and 70% Crippling Poison slow.'),
    'combat_potency': ('Replaces the random resource proc: every fifth eligible successful off-hand hit restores 15 energy.', 'Each eligible successful off-hand hit grants 5% attack speed for 4 sec, stacking up to 3 times, and has a separate 25% chance to restore 10 energy.'),
    'cheat_death': ('Retains normal activation conditions and internal cooldown. After preventing death, reduces damage taken by 90% for 4 sec, heals 10% maximum health over that time and reduces damage dealt by 20%.', 'Retains normal activation conditions and internal cooldown. After preventing death, reduces damage taken by 80% for 2 sec, restores 60 energy over 2 sec, resets Shadowstep and increases damage dealt by 25%.'),
    'honor_among_thieves': ('Retains normal allied critical-effect procs. Stores up to 2 overflow combo points for the same target and restores them after the next finisher. Changing target or losing the target removes the reserve.', 'Allied critical effects no longer grant combo points. Your eligible direct critical special attacks have a 50% chance to grant a point, capped at 2 additional points per second. Poisons, bleeds and item procs do not qualify.'),
}
